  nameEnglish: The Snezzer
  descriptionEnglish: Made by a crazy inventor who hunted platypuses in 1768. This
    crazy weapon connects directly to the user's nostrils to fire its shots. Not 
    OSHA  aproved
  nameChinese: "\u6253\u55B7\u568F\u7684\u4EBA"
  descriptionChinese: "\u7531\u4E00\u4F4D\u5728 1768 \u5E74\u730E\u6740\u9E2D\u5634\u517D\u7684\u75AF\u72C2\u53D1\u660E\u5BB6\u5236\u4F5C\u3002\u8FD9\u79CD\u75AF\u72C2\u7684\u6B66\u5668\u76F4\u63A5\u8FDE\u63A5\u5230\u7528\u6237\u7684\u9F3B\u5B54\u6765\u53D1\u5C04\u5B50\u5F39\u3002"
  namePortuguese: O EspirradorInator
  descriptionPortuguese: "Feito por um inventor maluco que ca\xE7ava ornitorrincos
    em 1768. Essa arma maluca se conecta diretamente com com as narinas do usuario
    para conseguir seus tiros. No minimo nojento e no maximo tamb\xEAm."
  nameSpanish: El Estornudo
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: Fabricada por un inventor loco que cazaba ornitorrincos
    en 1768. Esta loca arma se conecta directamente a las fosas nasales del usuario
    para disparar sus tiros.
